       "content": "# Popular Web Game Engines & Frameworks\n\n## 2D-Focused\n\n### **Phaser**\nThe most popular HTML5 game framework. Huge community, tons of tutorials.\n\n| Pros | Cons |\n|------|------|\n| Massive community & documentation | Can feel bloated for simple projects |\n| Built-in physics, audio, input, scene management | Not a true \"engine\" \u2014 it's a framework; you still wire things together |\n| Runs in",
